492 0 obj
  << /ActualText (MVP GOAL \050Very Important\051\nIn 10 weeks\054 the MVP should be able to\072\nTake a user\031s background \222 suggest 1\0232 career paths \222 show skill gaps \222 generate a simple\054 personalised learning roadmap \222 explain why those choices were made\056\nNot everything\056 Just this\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 493 0 R
     /Pg 476 0 R
     /S /Span
